replace him with the wan dynasty descendants of&nbsp;
kublai khan the usual careful planner this time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:22.560
committed a huge mistake good sense would dictate&nbsp;
initiating military campaigns in the spring to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:26.800
take advantage of the good weather and plentiful&nbsp;
pastures for the war horses but timur set off in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:33.280
december 1404 at the head of 200 000 troops his&nbsp;
astrologers had seen good omens in the stars but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:38.320
the weather begged to disagree frosty climber&nbsp;
made the trek increasingly difficult for the army&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:44.800
whilst crossing the seer daya river uzbekistan&nbsp;
the once undefeated leader fell ill possibly as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:49.920
a consequence of the cold the scourge of central&nbsp;
asia probably had wished for a glorious death in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:55.600
battle but in february of 1405 age 69 timur&nbsp;
