00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:09.200
and inspire the troops the expedition melted away&nbsp;
the two hundred thousand soldiers marched back to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:17.840
samakant timur's body embalmed in oils and laid&nbsp;
